  "heading_path": [
    "Trade Marks Act 1995",
    "Part 10—Assignment and transmission of trade marks",
    "107  Applications for record to be made of assignment etc. of trade mark whose registration is sought"
  ],
  "instrument": "TMA1995",
  "kind": "section",
  "number": "107",
  "ref": "TMA1995/s107",
  "text": "(1) If a trade mark whose registration is being sought is assigned or transmitted: (a) the applicant for the registration of the trade mark; or (b) the person to whom it has been assigned or transmitted; must apply to the Registrar for the assignment or transmission to be recorded. (2) The application must: (a) be in an approved form; and (b) be filed, together with any prescribed document, in accordance with the regulations. Note: For approved form and file see section 6.",
  "title": "Applications for record to be made of assignment etc. of trade mark whose registration is sought",
